h your skills to the limit.", "short_description": "Welcome to Monkey Hub VR!\nMonkey Hub VR is an immersive social hub with tons off fun game modes and maps such as Monke Games a crab game inspired game mode featuring unique Korean children's games or the horror mode were you break into the subliminal side of Monkey Hub VR and fight the mysterious entities.\n\nExperience a world like no other with not just your self but up to 10 players. Monkey Hub VR is a huge world with much to offer and is a place for everyone."}]}, "developer_name": "SpokGamez", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/monkey-hub-vr-policy/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://mhvrtos.my.canva.site/terms-of-service", "publisher_name": "Spokes", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://mhvr.my.canva.site/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "1700921480735423"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "9569857763076644"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_1155460796163245_5139862569660055667_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LZd2mmXoU8IQ7kNvwFfpFY3&_nc_oc=AdpIkPP1mJJV2O032SJCSCXPnh6b0zY1w0IEPWeadNgLTJOiRfikZhwfKdW3ZFrRs44&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQggDHNy6DQQNs