meplay, chaotic fun, and high-stakes challenges, Monkey Hub VR will push your skills to the limit.", "short_description": "Welcome to Monkey Hub VR!\nMonkey Hub VR is an immersive social hub with tons off fun game modes and maps such as Monke Games a crab game inspired game mode featuring unique Korean children's games or the horror mode were you break into the subliminal side of Monkey Hub VR and fight the mysterious entities.\n\nExperience a world like no other with not just your self but up to 10 players. Monkey Hub VR is a huge world with much to offer and is a place for everyone."}]}, "developer_name": "SpokGamez", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/monkey-hub-vr-policy/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Spokes", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://monkegamesvr.my.canva.site/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "1700921480735423"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "9317558544973235"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 0, "nodes": []}, "baseline_offer": null, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": []}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "9659359037459849", "version": "1.02"}, "id": "1180971820036441", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binari